                    <span>Agneau sélectionné</span>
                    <span>Pruneaux moelleux</span>
                    <span>Amandes grillées</span>
                    <span>Cannelle & Safran</span>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="action-row">
                  <span class="verified-tag">✓ Données certifiées par l'API Dishly</span>
                  <span class="author-tag" id="dishly-author">Par Kaoutar Bendidi</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- TAB 2: GENERATIVE STUDIO (CREATIVE CODING) -->
    <div class="tab-panel" id="panel-generative" role="tabpanel" hidden>
      <div class="lab-grid">
        
        <!-- Left: Interactive Canvas -->
        <div class="lab-card canvas-workbench">
          <div class="workbench-header">
            <span class="render-title">Algorithme Visuel Interactif (HTML5 Canvas)</span>
            <span class="live-status">● 60 FPS PROCÉDURAL</span>
          </div>

          <div class="canvas-container">
            <canvas id="generative-canvas" width="560" height="340" aria-label="Visualisation mathématique interactive"></canvas>
            <div class="canvas-tip">
              <span>👆 Déplacez votre curseur sur le canvas pour interagir avec les nœuds</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Controls -->
          <div class="controls-toolbar">
            <div class="control-field">
              <label for="slider-density">Complexité harmonique :</label>
              <input type="range" id="slider-density" min="4" max="16" value="8" />
            </div>

            <div class="control-field">
              <label for="slider-speed">Vitesse d'onde :</label>
              <input type="range" id="slider-speed" min="1" max="5" value="2" />
            </div>

            <button type="button" class="regen-btn" id="canvas-regen-btn">
              <span>↻ Réinitialiser</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: Mathematical Explanation & Code -->
        <div class="lab-card code-workbench">
          <div class="workbench-header">
            <div class="window-dots" aria-hidden="true">
              <span></span><span></span><span></span>
            </div>
            <span class="view-title">generative_matrix.py (Transposé JS)</span>
            <span class="tech-badge">Python · OpenCV · Algorithmes</span>
          </div>

          <div class="code-viewport">
            <pre class="code-block"><code># Calcul paramétrique des coordonnées harmoniques
def compute_harmonic_mesh(radius, nodes, phase, pointer):
    points = []
    step = (2 * math.pi) / nodes
    for i in range(nodes):
        theta = i * step + phase
        # Déformation vectorielle influencée par le curseur
        dx = pointer.x - (cx + radius * math.cos(theta))
        dy = pointer.y - (cy + radius * math.sin(theta))
        influence = 30 / (1 + (dx**2 + dy**2) * 0.0005)
        
        r = radius + influence * math.sin(theta * 3 + phase)
        points.append((cx + r * math.cos(theta), cy + r * math.sin(theta)))
    return points</code></pre>
          </div>

          <div class="workbench-footer-info">
            <div class="info-badge">📐 LOGIQUE ALGORIThMIQUE</div>
            <p class="info-text">
              Ce module illustre la logique de calcul matriciel développée dans mon projet <strong>Interactive Generative Studio</strong> : transformation de modèles mathématiques en visualisations fluides et réactives.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- TAB 3: DEVOPS & CI/CD PIPELINE -->
    <div class="tab-panel" id="panel-devops" role="tabpanel" hidden>
      <div class="devops-workbench lab-card">
        <div class="workbench-header">
          <div class="window-dots" aria-hidden="true">
            <span></span><span></span><span></span>
          </div>
          <span class="view-title">GitHub Actions · Pipeline d'Intégration & Déploiement Continu</span>
          <span class="tech-badge">CI/CD Automatisé</span>
        </div>

        <div class="pipeline-runner-body">
          <div class="pipeline-actions-bar">
            <div class="commit-info">
              <span class="branch-pill">main</span>
